This licence covers the SOURCE CODE in this repository only.

The trained weights and the published datasets are licensed separately, under
CC-BY-NC-4.0 (non-commercial), because every training corpus carries that
term and a derived work cannot be licensed more permissively than its inputs:

  ghanaopenai/ghana-pico-asr-twi           model weights
  ghanaopenai/twi-grapheme-unit-features   aligned feature store
  ghanaopenai/twi-grapheme-unit-pairs      (units, text) pairs

So: the code may be used commercially; the released weights and data may not.
Training your own weights on your own data leaves you free of that restriction.
